        "Dependence on imported recycling technologies increases supply chain vulnerabilities and costs, potentially limiting scalability and economic viability.",
        "Slow adoption of recycling technologies due to limited R&D investment may hinder India's ability to meet its EV and energy storage goals by 2030.",
        "Trade-offs between recycling efficiency and economic viability for small-scale operators could create resistance to formalization, requiring targeted policy interventions."
    ]
}
